CMake: raise the minimum required version to 3.5 for CMake 4

Derived from upstream SDDM commit 228778c2b4b7e26db1e1d69fe484ed75c5791c3a
by Heiko Becker <heiko.becker@kde.org> (2025-02-23), as Arch Linux applies
it to SDDM 0.21.0. 9Spokes added the modification notice on 2026-11-07, so
the result differs from that commit.
---
diff --git a/CMakeLists.txt b/CMakeLists.txt
--- a/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -1,4 +1,5 @@
-cmake_minimum_required(VERSION 3.4)
+# Modified for CMake 4 compatibility by Heiko Becker, 2025-02-23; notice added by 9Spokes, 2026-11-07.
+cmake_minimum_required(VERSION 3.5)
 
 project(SDDM)
 
